\title{tiABBA: totoInferno Atlas of Biological Bicor Analyses (tiABBA)}
\description{
This package implements totoInferno filtering to iteratively scan and elute core coexpressed gene networks. Additional tools expand on the results to generate a web app which can be used to quickly assess results. The primary use of this package is to automate gene network creation and present the user with faster decision making and analysis. Note that, while many options are presented, this package encourages the use of "minimum viable" filtering to maximize the accurate portrayal of the biological system. When in doubt, keep more genes!
